凤楼，含香朝入拜宸旒。\n金茎高擢仙人掌，露色还如汉阙秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6000,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送方江都赴召为考功郎 其三","author":"欧大任","text":"山公启事辟功曹，云里西京剑佩高。\n莫忆故人消渴日，秋风吹送广陵涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6001,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送方江都赴召为考功郎 其四","author":"欧大任","text":"芜城北望蓟丘台，木叶初飞朔气催。\n一片离心秋雁起，万家明月楚天来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6002,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴有定游洞庭山因讯顾季狂","author":"欧大任","text":"江阁莺声共醉闻，扁舟东访洞庭君。\n若逢顾恺丹青笔，写寄包山一片云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6003,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴孝甫见访即返江上","author":"欧大任","text":"白马倏辞邗水滨，应思桃叶渡头人。\n隋堤亦有千条柳，那似江南玉树春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6004,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈宜谦画梅","author":"欧大任","text":"旧识仙人萼绿华，石湖雪后楚天霞。\n醉骑白凤瑶池上，约过罗浮第几家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6005,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴叔承还新安 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"大鄣山前黄叶稀，游人江北行将归。\n相思千里芜城月，鸿雁翩翩何处飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6006,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴叔承还新安 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"一片孤城带落霞，万山风雪客还家。\n君歌水部杨州句，应念官梅几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6007,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯汝行赴保定别驾过广陵赋赠五首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"风流谁似大冯君，犹念寒毡郑广文。\n今夕淮南还赋别，桑乾归雁几时闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6008,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯汝行赴保定别驾过广陵赋赠五首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"赵北燕南节制雄，汉家深倚右扶风。\n看君别乘行春去，桑枣阴连一郡中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6009,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯汝行赴保定别驾过广陵赋赠五首 其三","author":"欧大任","text":"高生击筑和燕歌，客似田光侠气多。\n行向部中询故事，千山风雨下滹沱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6010,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯汝行赴保定别驾过广陵赋赠五首 其四","author":"欧大任","text":"三关旗帜拥秋云，上谷精兵天下闻。\n报道儒臣为郡吏，边城不用霍将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":6011,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯汝行赴保定别驾过广陵赋赠五首 其五","author":"欧大任","text":"府中宾从醉蒲萄，挟瑟当筵赵曲高。\n他夜尊前能忆我，月明应拂吕虔刀。","collection":"明","notice"